SUMMARY:Diebuster (2006)
LOCATION:Hollywood Theatre\, 4122 NE Sandy Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5315;-122.624
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Katsuichi Nakayama · 96 min\n\nNono is a clumsy waitress 
 who dreams of becoming a space pilot. One day\, she meets Lal'C Melk Mark\
 , a member of the elite psychic pilot team "Topless." But when space monst
 ers appear from out of nowhere to wreak havoc on Mars\, Lal'C calls out he
 r Buster Machine—codenamed "Dix-Neuf"—to subdue the threat. During a b
 attle with a Space Monster\, Lal'C gets the surprise of her life when she 
 sees Nono use her super-strength to help Dix-Neuf destroy the alien. From 
 that point\, Nono hangs along with Lal'C in hopes of becoming a member of 
 Topless.\n\nTickets: https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/diebuster-2026-11-
 15-700pm/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-p
 dx/
URL:https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/diebuster-2026-11-15-700pm/
